WEBVTT

00:15:57.771 --> 00:16:01.825
Because, all these
terrible scenarios I've painted --

00:16:01.849 --> 00:16:03.758
they are not destiny.

00:16:04.171 --> 00:16:05.528
They're optional.

00:16:06.012 --> 00:16:09.619
The danger is still kind of distant.

00:16:10.247 --> 00:16:13.010
And that means it will only befall us

00:16:13.034 --> 00:16:15.222
if we allow it to.

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:17.144
Let's not.

00:16:17.168 --> 00:16:18.884
Thank you very much for listening.

00:16:18.908 --> 00:16:23.460
(Applause)